  "description": "Description\nThe Jeep rear bumper can be installed directly without cutting or drilling. It is coated with a black textured finish and enhanced by pretreatment to provide strong rust and wear resistance. Made of 5/32\" iron plate to increase the strength of the load-bearing area. Equipped with D-ring brackets welded inside and outside to increase strength. It not only makes your car look stronger but also provides protection in a collision.\nFeatures\nFor Your Convenience Design: Standard Size Hitch Receiver, Included D-Ring Shackles, Special Decors\n2'' Receiver Hitch: 2inch trailer hitch makes a simple connection point for towing your racks, bags, bike, and payload transporters, and so forth\nSpare Tire Mount Allowed: Enough space for an extra tire up to a 35-inch one.\nFull Protection: Made of 5/32\" steel sheets that reinforce the strength of the weight-bearing locale. Outfitted with D-ring mounts welded all around for expanded strength.\nAll-Weather Guard: Finished with dark powder-covering and upgraded by pre-treatment to give outrageous opposition against rust and wear.\n1-year warranty. For your safety, professional installation recommended.\nFitment\nFits for 1987-1996 Jeep Wrangler YJ 2-Door All Models (Base, Sahara, Laredo, SE, Islander, Rio Grande, Renegade, S)\nFits for 1997-2006 Jeep Wrangler TJ 2-Door All Models (Rubicon, Sahara, Sport, SE, Unlimited, Unlimited Rubicon, X)\nNote: The shackle is not designed for towing and recovery, refer to the owner's manual for towing and rescue information. Overload is not included in after-sales service.",
